{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1968","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Assembly via Remainders"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$x_2,x_3,\\dots,x_n$$$. Your task is to find "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" array $$$a_1,\\dots,a_n$$$, where: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1\\le a_i\\le 10^9$$$ for all $$$1\\le i\\le n$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$x_i=a_i \\bmod a_{i-1}$$$ for all $$$2\\le i\\le n$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here $$$c\\bmod d$$$ denotes the remainder of the division of the integer $$$c$$$ by the integer $$$d$$$. For example $$$5 \\bmod 2 = 1$$$, $$$72 \\bmod 3 = 0$$$, $$$143 \\bmod 14 = 3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that if there is more than one $$$a$$$ which satisfies the statement, you are allowed to find any."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ $$$(1\\le t\\le 10^4)$$$ — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ $$$(2\\le n\\le 500)$$$ — the number of elements in $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n-1$$$ integers $$$x_2,\\dots,x_n$$$ $$$(1\\le x_i\\le 500)$$$ — the elements of $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of values $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case output any $$$a_1,\\dots,a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$) which satisfies the statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n4\n2 4 1\n3\n1 1\n6\n4 2 5 1 2\n2\n500\n3\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 5 4 9\n2 5 11\n5 14 16 5 11 24\n501 500\n2 7 5"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case $$$a=[3,5,4,9]$$$ satisfies the conditions, because: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_2\\bmod a_1=5\\bmod 3=2=x_2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_3\\bmod a_2=4\\bmod 5=4=x_3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_4\\bmod a_3=9\\bmod 4=1=x_4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1968C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1968/problem/C"}